dev_web > dev_api: API + log proxy
dev_mobile > dev_api: API + log proxy
dev_web > dev_neon: server database access
dev_api > dev_neon: database access
dev_web > dev_clerk: dev auth
dev_mobile > dev_clerk: dev auth
dev_mobile > dev_firebase: Firestore sync
